  "body": "## [4.48.2](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/compare/v4.48.1...v4.48.2) (2026-11-12)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **ci:** authorize current sdk11 source qualification tuple ([6ad5854](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/6ad5854aa14a9950e1fbfc32d7e27953a1c4b82b))\n* **host:** retain current catalog extension assemblies ([1247235](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/12472357225b78ae3a2647a832504261cc078266))\n* **release:** retain package drafts when original artifacts are gone ([d4f7528](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/d4f75283221fc11779416c5f2b531ea09f22582c))\n* **runtime:** recognize verified memories 3.0.27 declarations ([040c7cf](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/040c7cf4c309c1cac925c33c9429c432f915fb1a))\n* **validation:** isolate bounded catalog evaluator streams ([0068138](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/00681381c5c81069623478fd75f8650333542d82))\n"
